"text": " In four minutes, one man scored the most famous handball in World Cup history and the greatest goal. June 22nd, 1986. Mexico City. Argentina against England in the quarterfinal. 51 minutes. A looping ball drops towards England's goalkeeper. Diego Maradona jumps and punches it in with his hand. The goal stands. Maradona later said it was scored a little with the hand of God. Four minutes later he picks up the ball in his own half He turns and runs Past one England player Then another and another Around the goalkeeper and in In 2002 a FIFA online poll voted it the goal of the century Argentina won 2-1 and went on to win the World Cup Cheat or genius? Tell me in the comments",
